
### 启动任务
POST {{base_url}}/api/tasks/start?taskId=stockCheck&intervalSeconds=5
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### 停止任务
POST {{base_url}}/api/tasks/stop?taskId=stockCheck
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### 查询任务状态
GET {{base_url}}/api/tasks/status?taskId=stockCheck
Authorization: Bearer 123456



### 重新任务
POST {{base_url}}/api/stock/start
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### 停止任务
POST {{base_url}}/api/stock/stop
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### 查询任务状态
GET {{base_url}}/api/stock/status
Authorization: Bearer 123456



### 手工触发日报
POST {{base_url}}/api/tasks/daily-report
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### 手工触发周报
POST {{base_url}}/api/tasks/weekly-report
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### 手工触发月报
POST {{base_url}}/api/tasks/monthly-report
Authorization: Bearer 123456